+/** select speed when mode is 1
+ *      0 - 10G Quad USXGMII
+ *       1 - 1000BaseX ANeg
+ *       2 - 10G XFI
+ *       3 - 10G Single USXGMII
+ *       4 - 2.5G SGMII
+ *       5 - 2500 Single USXGMI
+ *       6 - 2500BaseX NonANeg
+ *       7 - 1000BaseX NonANeg
+ *       8 - 1G SGMI
+ */
