+ *   bit 15 = RESET      (must be 0)
+ *   bit 12 = AN_ENABLE  (must be 1)
+ *   bit  9 = RESTART_AN (must be 0; transient self-clears during AN)
+ *
+ * IEEE Std 802.3 Clause 45 §45.2.7.2 (MMD7.1 / MDIO_STAT1):
+ *   bit  5 = AN_COMPLETE   (must be 1)
+ *   bit  4 = REMOTE_FAULT  (latched; must be 0)
+ *   bit  3 = AN_ABLE       (must be 1)
